  "landing.security.title": "Your shop’s data stays yours",
  "landing.security.body": "Smart Outlet is an independent record-keeping tool. We never ask for bank or UIDAI credentials, and sensitive numbers are blocked at entry.",
  "landing.security.p1": "Aadhaar & card numbers rejected at entry",
  "landing.security.p2": "Encrypted sessions, audit trail on every action",
  "landing.security.p3": "Your records are isolated to your shop",
  "landing.faq.title": "Questions, answered",
  "landing.faq.q1": "Is Smart Outlet affiliated with a bank or the government?",
  "landing.faq.a1": "No. Smart Outlet is an independent tool for keeping your own records. It is not affiliated with any bank, payment network or government body, and it does not process transactions.",
  "landing.faq.q2": "Do I need the internet all the time?",
  "landing.faq.a2": "No. You can record on a weak or dropped connection. Drafts stay on your device and sync automatically — the same record is never saved twice.",
  "landing.faq.q3": "Does it store Aadhaar or card numbers?",
  "landing.faq.a3": "No. Fields that look like an Aadhaar or card number are rejected at entry, so they are never stored.",
  "landing.faq.q4": "Can my staff use it with limited access?",
  "landing.faq.a4": "Yes. Add operators and grant exactly the permissions you choose. Every action is recorded in an audit trail.",
  "landing.faq.q5": "What does it cost?",
  "landing.faq.a5": "You can start free. If you need higher limits, staff or exports, you can upgrade — upgrades are reviewed and activated manually, with no automatic charges.",
  "landing.faq.q6": "Is it available in Hindi?",
  "landing.faq.a6": "Yes. Switch between Hindi and English anytime from the top of any screen.",
